{"synopsis":"Ash mengabdikan seluruh hidupnya kepada ayah angkatnya, bertekad membalas budi karena telah diterima dan dibesarkan sebagai seorang yatim piatu.\n\nNamun, kebenaran yang ia ketahui tepat di ambang kematian ternyata sama sekali berbeda.\n\nSemua usaha yang telah ia bangun…\n\nSemua kepercayaan yang telah ia berikan…\n\nBahkan kekuatan terhebat yang sejak awal terlahir bersamanya —Seven Wings—\n\nSemuanya telah dirampas darinya…!\n\nKalau begitu…\n\nAkankah kita memulai kehidupan pembalasan dan pembalikan takdir?","alternative_title":"暴君名家の反逆者-Aster-","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"f9665949-fc11-4839-b309-7e3d361d61df","date":"2026-07-28","images":[]},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"ff330372-a8c8-4c54-96b5-7bc66ae9d9e9","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"0a769328-e5bd-4c29-816e-2faaf686172a","date":"2026-07-16","images":[]},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"e5672990-4121-4b34-ba54-bb1e9df2febd","date":"2026-07-07","images":[]},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"e12a600c-0891-4057-bb39-25bbb276a981","date":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"7dbf26b0-16c3-440d-aac1-11bd40e478b9","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"37918886-a349-43ba-8493-5332a1607cca","date":"2026-06-16","images":[]},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"5b9f3ccb-5949-40f9-bd92-b07b1f05311f","date":"2026-06-09","images":[]},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"125bc20d-8fa5-4b41-aad9-34287a56eeeb","date":"2026-06-03","images":[]},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"05776617-e79c-4347-9ca6-706099495b14","date":"2026-05-27","images":[]},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"00f6ae4a-92c2-42d6-aa75-b241038c0ff9","date":"2026-05-19","images":[]},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"64978f4b-3192-4538-ad07-94da97aea052","date":"2026-05-12","images":[]},{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"edbdf69c-b374-4f8c-ba65-33bb89ce3